# Copy to `.env.local` to enable conversational answers in the RAG terminal.
#
# The terminal works with this UNSET — it falls back to returning the retrieved
# passages verbatim, entirely in the browser. Setting this makes it phrase those
# passages as prose instead.
#
# Point it at a small serverless function that holds your API key and forwards
# to a model. Never put the key itself in a VITE_* variable: everything prefixed
# VITE_ is inlined into the JavaScript bundle and is public.
#
# Your endpoint receives POST { question, context, system } and should respond
# with { answer: "..." }.
VITE_RAG_ENDPOINT=
